WEBVTT

00:08:28.855 --> 00:08:30.093
U ovom slučaju,

00:08:30.117 --> 00:08:33.316
manje je verovatno da će
imune ćelije jetre pojesti

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.289
biološke nanočestice.

00:08:35.691 --> 00:08:38.619
Koristimo koncept Trojanskog konja

00:08:38.643 --> 00:08:40.230
da zavaramo jetru.

00:08:40.921 --> 00:08:43.278
Ovde vidimo biološke nanočestice

00:08:43.302 --> 00:08:44.881
kako cirkulišu kroz krv.

00:08:44.905 --> 00:08:47.301
Jetra ih ne prepoznaje,

00:08:47.325 --> 00:08:49.489
i one završavaju u tumoru.

00:08:50.413 --> 00:08:51.849
U budućnosti,

00:08:51.873 --> 00:08:55.396
želimo da iskoristimo
prirodne nanočestice

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:57.493
za prenos lekova za kancer,

00:08:58.387 --> 00:09:01.323
kako bismo smanjili
neželjene efekte i sačuvali živote